  "text": "Resort Accommodation Offers | Rooms & Suites - Chiva-Som Get In Touch Contact WhatsApp LINE E-Mail Search Search Featured Suite Leelawadee Suite Our largest, most exclusive suite with its own secluded garden, jacuzzi and terrace. This resort accommodation offers a real home-from-home comfort with its spacious living space opening onto the private garden, plus two bathrooms, three toilets, a large dressing area and a pantry. LEARN MORE Golden Bo Suite This particularly large suite has its own roof terrace with sun and shade and its own private access to both the resort pool and Taste of Siam restaurant. The separate living, dressing and dining rooms in his resort accommodation are designed in authentic Thai style with silk, teak and bamboo motifs. Learn More Champaka Suite Experience the Champaka Suite, a spacious and luminous retreat that exudes a breathtaking ambiance. This distinctive suite boasts a generous terrace accessible from both the bedroom and living room, ideal for soaking in the views. Unwind on Thai daybeds, elegantly adorned in soft blue fabric, which beautifully harmonises the gentle blue tones of the interior with the sparkling azure waters of the sea. Learn More Jasmine Suite The early morning light softly fills the living room and bedroom of our Jasmine Suite, where the ocean view is always captivating. This resort accommodation boasts a spacious living room, featuring a calming blend of soft purples and greens. Louvred doors welcome refreshing sea breezes, enhancing the tranquil atmosphere. Learn More Thai Pavilion Suite These are our newer suites, the only one to have a private sala with a pantry and round table to entertain up to six guests. The sala doubles as a beautiful meditation space being surrounded by glass doors opening into nature on three sides. This suite feels as though it’s floating on its own island in a lagoon because it’s built at the water’s edge amongst the trees. Learn More Patchouli Suite Perched on the top floor, the Patchouli Suite boasts breathtaking views of the Gulf of Thailand. This exquisite suite features an ocean-facing terrace complete with sun loungers, conveniently accessible from a generously sized living room and the bedroom. Elegantly adorned in soothing green tones and refined bamboo panelling, the suite exudes a serene ambiance. Learn More Juniper Suite Perched on the top floor, the Juniper Suite offers stunning sunrise views over the lush treetops that shade the resort. It includes a terrace extending from the bedroom, along with a separate living room, bathroom, and dressing room. The warm purple palette complements the elegant interior lines, creating a serene and inviting atmosphere. Learn More Anchan Our Anchan room offers generous internal space, decorated in natural hues for a particularly peaceful ambience. The adjoining bedroom and living areas open out onto one long terrace with loungers, helping you appreciate the restorative power of nature all around you. Learn More Thai Pavilion These intimate suites lie some distance from the resort’s main building, in the heart of our lush, leafy gardens. The bedroom opens onto a screened terrace with surrounding sounds of nature that help you balance your nervous system and transition into a new state of mind. Learn More Ocean Premium These are our most spacious ocean side rooms with separate bedrooms, bathroom, living and dressing rooms, all decorated with natural textures. These rooms also have wide terraces with sea views. Learn More Ocean Deluxe These are rooms that feel like suites, all with terraces that face the ocean. They have a separate bathroom and dressing area and natural textures to help restore a calm, contented mind. Learn More Ocean Room Ocean Rooms give you everything you need to calm your state of mind. The terrace allows you to look out from your bed over our lush gardens or swimming pool, thanks to floor to ceiling doors designed to bring outside nature in. Learn More Frequently Asked Questions How do I decide which room or suite is right for me? Browse our website to see which room type suits you best – each comes with photos, size and unique features. Once you’ve booked, simply let our Reservations team know your preferred category and we’ll do our best to accommodate your request, subject to availability. Which suite has a private jacuzzi or garden? The Leelawadee Suite includes its own secluded garden and jacuzzi. The Golden Bo Suite has a private roof terrace with direct access to the resort pool. What are included in a stay at Chiva-Som Hua Hin? Every stay includes luxury accommodation, an individual health and wellness consultation upon arrival, three wellness cuisine meals per night of stay, a complimentary physical analysis, full access to our fitness and leisure activities, and use of our Water Therapy suites. What are the check-in and check-out time? Check-in at Chiva-Som Hua Hin is from 3:00 pm, with check-out by 12:00 pm (noon). Are daily spa treatments included in all room types? Yes. Regardless of the room category or suite you choose, all guests receive complimentary daily spa treatment of choice.",
